                                RandChat...
                            -----------------

Randchat is only a simpel AREXX-script that displays ,from an unlimitited 
no of files, Chattexts.
All you have to do is to install the script RandChat.REXX in your PFILES: 
dir., make a dir in PFILES: called Chattext and copy all the chat-ascii's 
there. Then you have to edit your 'bbstext' file (lies in CNET: ). The
lines #928 and #934 as follows:

line #928 should be altered to:

 /#0 Pfiles:Randchat.REXX END} 
 ^                         ^
 |                         | 
 |                     Any argument will do for the 'end', texts...
That's a <CTRL+Q>.

Line #934 should be altered to:

 /#0 Pfiles:Randchat.REXX Chat}
 ^                          ^
 |                          |
 |                        The argument here MUST be Chat for the starttexts..
That's a <CTRL+Q>.

To add more chat-asciis,just put them in your Chattext dir. and name them to
chat.n or end.n (where n is the number next in range).

Then edit the line in the RandChat.REXX file that looks like:

MaxFiles=4 

and change the 4 to the number of texts you got.
Just remember that you must have as many chat.n texts as you got end.n texts!

